{
  "description": "Minimal representative fixture for setup/extensiontest.mjs (EXT-16): the shape of the long web flow QA/Flows/web/tasks/tasks-browse-and-open.flow.json — browse the task list, search and filter it, open one task, read its history, go back — with a check after every meaningful move, each allowed to wait.",
  "folder": "tasks",
